---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="前后对比 | 产品与服务">
  <section class="review-page">
    <div class="review-head">
      <div>
        <p>Design Review</p>
        <h1>产品与服务页前后对比</h1>
        <span>左侧是当前版本，右侧是 Impeccable 审查后的轻量 polish 提案。提案只用于可视化审查，不会替换正式页面。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="review-links">
        <a href="/products" target="_blank">打开当前版</a>
        <a href="/products-polish" target="_blank">打开提案版</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="review-notes">
      <article>
        <strong>当前版</strong>
        <p>结构清楚，4 个服务已经是 2×2，但仍然偏“卡片矩阵”。英文小标签和表格让页面略有模板感。</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <strong>提案版</strong>
        <p>保留原有信息，弱化卡片边界，增加服务承诺层级，减少重复英文标签，让它更像专业服务目录。</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="review-grid">
      <section class="review-panel">
        <header>
          <strong>Before</strong>
          <span>当前产品与服务页</span>
        </header>
        <div class="review-frame">
          <iframe src="/products" title="当前产品与服务页"></iframe>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="review-panel">
        <header>
          <strong>After</strong>
          <span>轻量优化提案</span>
        </header>
        <div class="review-frame">
          <iframe src="/products-polish" title="产品与服务优化提案"></iframe>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
